{"words": [{"text": "إِنَّمَا", "translation": "Only"}, {"text": "حَرَّمَ", "translation": "He has forbidden"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمُ", "translation": "to you"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَيْتَةَ", "translation": "the dead animals"}, {"text": "وَٱلدَّمَ", "translation": "and [the] blood"}, {"text": "وَلَحْمَ", "translation": "and flesh"}, {"text": "ٱلْخِنزِيرِ", "translation": "(of) swine"}, {"text": "وَمَآ", "translation": "and what"}, {"text": "أُهِلَّ", "translation": "has been dedicated"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ", "translation": "[with it]"}, {"text": "لِغَيْرِ", "translation": "to other than"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۖ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "فَمَنِ", "translation": "So whoever"}, {"text": "ٱضْطُرَّ", "translation": "(is) forced by necessity"}, {"text": "غَيْرَ", "translation": "without"}, {"text": "بَاغٍۢ", "translation": "(being) disobedient"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and not"}, {"text": "عَادٍۢ", "translation": "transgressor"}, {"text": "فَلَآ", "translation": "then no"}, {"text": "إِثْمَ", "translation": "sin"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِ ۚ", "translation": "on him"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "غَفُورٌۭ", "translation": "(is) Oft-Forgiving"}, {"text": "رَّحِيمٌ", "translation": "Most Merciful"}], "sahih": "He has only forbidden to you dead animals,1 blood, the flesh of swine, and that which has been dedicated to other than Allāh. But whoever is forced [by necessity], neither desiring [it] nor transgressing [its limit], there is no sin upon him. Indeed, Allāh is Forgiving and Merciful."}